  Summon_131639_LongDesc1 = {
    Text = [[
[<SummonOrange:Moonless Guide>] Self-Select Character Awakening is now open. During the event, Keepers can <SummonOrange:select> a specified number of Awakeners to receive Rate-Up.

During the event, the Awakening rate for selected items will be increased.
In this Character Selection Awakener Limited-Time Awakening, all Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny use base rates, except for special rules such as rate-up triggers and pity. Please refer to the rules for details.

<Title:[Balance Adjustments]>
Due to the unique nature of the gameplay, in order to ensure fun and fairness, the game may apply balance adjustments to weaken or strengthen effects on Awakeners and Wheels of Destiny.
When a nerf occurs, the game will activate a limited-time reversion feature, allowing Awakeners and Wheels of Destiny to have the opportunity to redeploy resources for progression or Awakening.
Please make sure you understand and accept this before investing resources.

]]
  },
  Summon_131639_LongDesc2 = {
    Text = [[
<Title:[SSR Items]>
In the [<SummonOrange:Moonless Guide>] Self-Select Character Awakening, the base rate for obtaining SSR items is 3.03%, and the overall rate (including pity) is 5.02%. SSR items obtained are Awakeners. An SSR Awakener is guaranteed via pity within at most 30 Awakenings.
When an SSR is obtained through Awakening, there is a 50% chance it will be the selected SSR <SummonOrange:Awakener> for this period.
If the SSR obtained in this Awakening is not the selected SSR Awakener for this period, the next SSR obtained through Awakening will be guaranteed to be the selected SSR Awakener for this period.{s1}
You have currently obtained non-selected Awakeners {s2} <plural value="{s2}" singular="time" plural="times"> in a row.{s3}

<Title:[SR Items]>
In the [<SummonOrange:Moonless Guide>] Event Awakening, the base rate for obtaining SR items is 15.85%, and the overall rate (including pity) is 25.00%. All SR items in this Awakening are Wheels of Destiny.
An SR or higher item is guaranteed via pity within at most 5 Awakenings. The chance of obtaining an SR item via pity is 96.97%, and the chance of obtaining an SSR item is 3.03%.

<Title:[Special Notes]>
When an SSR Wheel of Destiny is obtained through Awakening, 50 Radix Sediment will also be obtained as a byproduct; when an SR Wheel of Destiny is obtained through Awakening, 5 Radix Sediment will also be obtained as a byproduct; when an R Wheel of Destiny is obtained, 1 Radix Sediment will also be obtained as a byproduct.
Additional rewards per Awakening:
SR Wheel of Destiny: 5 Radix Sediments
R Wheel of Destiny: 1 Radix Sediment
Duplicate SSR Awakener conversion (including other means of acquisiton, such as the Store and Free Units):
2nd-16th copies: 1 Awakener Shard + 50 Radix Sediments
17th+ copies: non-limited SSR Awakeners will convert into 1 Soul Rewind Shard + 150 Radix Sediments
limited SSR Awakener will convert into 2 Soul Rewind Shards + 250 Radix Sediments.
Note: No conversion occurs when an Awakener is obtained through Self-Selection methods (including Protoparadise, Soul Rewind Core, and Prototype Horizon) and Random-drops (such as Sepirot Capture: Faded Legacy).
This Awakening is a [Self-Select Character Awakening]. In any [Self-Select Character Awakening], pity counts are accumulated together and tracked independently from pity counts of other Awakening types.

]]
  },
