  Summon_133266_LongDesc1 = {
    Text = [[
[<SummonOrange:Kaleido Recollections: Faded Legacy>] Walks of All Life Awakening is available!
During the event, Keepers can awaken all Faded Legacy limited Awakeners and WoDs.
Except for special rules (e.g., rate boosts, guarantees), all drops use base probabilities. See Rules for details.
Daily Discount: 60 Silver Prime per Awakening (+60 Silver bonus).

<Title:[Balance Adjustment]>
Because of Morimens' unique gameplay, Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny may be buffed or nerfed via balance adjustments to ensure fun and fairness.
If nerfed, a Limited-Time Reset event allows resource refunds.
Please acknowledge this before investing resources.

]]
  },
  Summon_133266_LongDesc2 = {
    Text = [[
[SSR Items]
In the [Kaleido Recollections: Faded Legacy] Walks of All Life Awakening, the base probability for obtaining SSR items is 3.03%, with an overall probability (including guarantees) of 5.02%. SSR items obtained will be either Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny, with a guaranteed SSR Awakener or Wheel of Destiny after a maximum of 30 Awakenings.
When obtaining an SSR through Awakening, there is a 33.33% chance it will be an SSR Awakener.
If 2 consecutive SSRs obtained through Awakening are Wheels of Destiny, the next SSR obtained through Awakening is guaranteed to be an Awakener.
If 2 consecutive SSRs obtained through Awakening are Awakeners, the next SSR obtained through Awakening is guaranteed to be a Wheel of Destiny.{s1}
Current status: {s2} consecutive SSR Awakener(s) obtained.{s3}
Current status: {s4} consecutive SSR Wheel(s) of Destiny obtained.{s3}

[SR Items]
In the [Kaleido Recollections: Faded Legacy] character activity Awakening, the base probability for obtaining SR items is 15.85%, with an overall probability (including guarantees) of 25.00%. All SR items in this Awakening are Wheels of Destiny.
A guaranteed SR or higher item is provided every 5 Awakenings, with a 96.97% chance for an SR item and a 3.03% chance for an SSR item via guarantee.

[Special Notes]
When obtaining an SSR Wheel of Destiny through Awakening, 50 Radix Sediments will be granted as a bonus; when obtaining an SR Wheel of Destiny, 5 Radix Sediments will be granted; when obtaining an R Wheel of Destiny, 1 Radix Sediment will be granted.
Duplicate SSR WoD conversion (including other means of acquisiton, such as the Store and Free Units):
2nd-16th copies: Automatic Ascension + 50 Radix Sediments
17th+ copies: non-limited SSR WoDs will convert into 1 Fate Rewind Shard + 50 Radix Sediments + 20,000 Rose Scrips;
limited SSR WoDs will convert into 2 Fate Rewind Shards + 50 Radix Sediments + 20,000 Rose Scrips
Duplicate SSR Awakener conversion:
2nd-16th copies: 1 Awakener Shard + 50 Radix Sediments
17th+ copies:
Standard Awakeners: 1 Soul Rewind Shard + 150 Radix Sediments;
Limited Awakeners: 2 Soul Rewind Shards + 250 Radix Sediments
Note: No Radix Sediment conversion occurs when an Awakener or surplus Awakener Shards are obtained through Self-Selection methods (including Protoparadise, Soul Rewind Core, and Prototype Horizon) or Random-drop methods (such as Sepirot Capture: Faded Legacy).
This Awakening belongs to [Walks of All Life Awakening]. The pity count is shared across all [Walks of All Life Awakening] banners and is tracked separately from other Awakening types.]]
