  Summon_138837_LongDesc2 = {
    Text = [[
<Title:[SSR Items]>
In the [<SummonRed:Echoing Wishes>] Oathbound Oracle, the base probability for obtaining SSR items is 3.03%, with an overall probability (including guarantees) of 5.02%. All SSR items are Awakeners, with a guaranteed SSR Awakener or SSR WoD after maximum 30 Awakenings.
When obtaining an SSR through Awakening, there is a 33.33% chance it will be the current Rate-Up SSR Awakener <SummonRed:Doresain> and SSR WoD <SummonRed:"Kiss of Repose">.
If the current SSR obtained through Awakening is not the selected Rate-Up SSR Awakener or WoD, the next SSR will be guaranteed to be the selected Rate-Up SSR Awakener or WoD.{s1}
Current status: {s2} consecutive non-selected Rate-Up Awakeners or WoDs obtained.{s3}
If two consecutive Rate-Up items obtained through Awakening are the same, the next Rate-Up item will be guaranteed to be the other Rate-Up item.
Current status: {s4} consecutive Rate-Up Awakeners obtained.
Current status: {s5} consecutive Rate-Up WoDs obtained.

<Title:[SR Items]>
In the [<SummonRed:Echoing Wishes>] Event Awakening, the base probability for SR items is 15.85%, with overall probability (including guarantees) of 25.00%. All SR items obtained will be Wheels of Destiny.
Guaranteed SR or higher item every 5 Awakenings, with:
96.97% chance for SR item
3.03% chance for SSR item

<Title:[Special Notes]>
Additional rewards per Awakening:
SSR Wheel of Destiny: 50 Radix Sediments
SR Wheel of Destiny: 5 Radix Sediments
R Wheel of Destiny: 1 Radix Sediment

Duplicate SSR WoD conversion (including other means of acquisition, such as the Store and Free Units):
2nd-16th copies: Automatic Ascension + 50 Radix Sediments
17th+ copies: non-limited SSR WoDs will convert into 1 Fate Rewind Shard + 50 Radix Sediments + 20,000 Rose Scrips;
limited SSR WoDs will convert into 2 Fate Rewind Shards + 50 Radix Sediments + 20,000 Rose Scrips.

Duplicate SSR Awakener conversion (including other means of acquisition, such as the Store and Free Units):
2nd-16th copies: 1 Awakener Shard + 50 Radix Sediments
17th+ copies: non-limited SSR Awakeners will convert into 1 Soul Rewind Shard + 150 Radix Sediments;
limited SSR Awakeners will convert into 2 Soul Rewind Shards + 250 Radix Sediments.
Note: No conversion occurs when an Awakener is obtained through Self-Selection methods (including Protoparadise, Soul Rewind Core, and Prototype Horizon) and Random-drops (such as Sepirot Capture: Faded Legacy).
This Awakening belongs to [Oathbound Oracle]:
Pity count carries over between all [Oathbound Oracle], and maintains separate counter from other Awakening types.

]]
