  Summon_138849_LongDesc1 = {
    Text = [[
[<SummonOrange:Kaleido Recollections: Astral Reign>] Walks of All Life Awakening is available! During the event period, Keepers can awaken all Astral Reign limited Awakeners and WoDs.
In this Limited-Time Event Awakening, except for special rules such as increased trigger probabilities and guarantees, all Awakeners or Destiny Wheels will use the base probabilities, as specified in the rules explanation.
Daily Discount: 60 Silver Prime per Awakening (+60 Silver bonus).


<Title:[Balance Adjustment]>
Because of Morimens' unique gameplay, Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny may be buffed or nerfed via balance adjustments to ensure fun and fairness.
If nerfed, a Limited-Time Reset event allows for a resource refund.
Please acknowledge this before investing resources.

]]
  },
  Summon_138849_LongDesc2 = {
    Text = [[
<Title:[SSR Items]>
In the [<SummonOrange:Kaleido Recollections: Astral Reign>] Walks of All Life Awakening, the base probability to obtain an SSR item is 3.03%, and the overall probability (including guaranteed odds) is 5.02%. SSR items are Awakeners or WoDs, with a guaranteed SSR item after maximum 30 Awakenings.
When obtaining an SSR item through awakening, there is a 33.33% chance it will be an SSR Awakener.
If you acquire WoD twice in a row, the next SSR will be an Awakener.
If you acquire Awakeners twice in a row, the next SSR will be a WoD.{s1}
You have currently consecutively obtained SSR Awakeners for {s2} .{s3}
You have currently consecutively obtained SSR WoDs for {s4} .{s3}

<Title:[SR Item]>
In the Character Event Awakening of [<SummonOrange:Kaleido Recollections: Astral Reign>], the base probability to obtain an SR item is 15.85%, and the overall probability (including guaranteed odds) is 25.00%. All SR items in this awakening are WoDs.
After a maximum of 5 awakenings, you are guaranteed to obtain an SR or higher item through the guaranteed odds. The probability of obtaining an SR item through guaranteed odds is 96.97%, and the probability of obtaining an SSR item is 3.03%.

<Title:[Special Notes]>
<Title:[Special Notes]>

Additional rewards per Awakening:

SSR Wheel of Destiny: 50 Radix Sediments

SR Wheel of Destiny: 5 Radix Sediments

R Wheel of Destiny: 1 Radix Sediment

Duplicate SSR WoD conversion (including other means of acquisition, such as the Store and Free Units):
2nd-16th copies: Automatic Ascension + 50 Radix Sediments
17th+ copies: non-limited SSR WoDs will convert into 1 Fate Rewind Shard + 50 Radix Sediments + 20,000 Rose Scrips;
limited SSR WoDs will convert into 2 Fate Rewind Shards + 50 Radix Sediments + 20,000 Rose Scrips

Duplicate SSR Awakener conversion (including other means of acquisition, such as the Store and Free Units):
2nd-16th copies: 1 Awakener Shard + 50 Radix Sediments
17th+ copies: non-limited SSR Awakeners will convert into 1 Soul Rewind Shard + 150 Radix Sediments
limited SSR Awakener will convert into 2 Soul Rewind Shards + 250 Radix Sediments.
Note: No conversion occurs when an Awakener is obtained through Self-Selection methods (including Protoparadise, Soul Rewind Core, and Prototype Horizon) and Random-drops (such as Sepirot Capture: Astral Reign).
This awakening belongs to the [Walks of All Life Awakening]. In any [Walks of All Life Awakening], the guaranteed awakening count will be accumulated collectively, and it will be statistically independent from the guaranteed awakening counts of other awakening types.

]]
  },
