  Summon_14117_LongDesc1 = {
    Text = [[
[Realm Study] is a Permanent Character Awakening banner where Keepers can change the designated Realm at any time to obtain Awakeners from different Realms. The currently selected Realm is [<SummonOrange:Chaos>].
After selecting a Realm in [Realm Study], you can obtain Awakeners and Wheels of Destiny through awakening. If an Awakener is obtained, it will definitely be from the designated Realm.
In [Realm Study], all Awakeners and Wheels of Destiny use base probabilities unless affected by special rules such as increased rates or guarantees. Specific details are subject to the Rules section.

<Title:[Balance Adjustments]>
Due to the game's unique mechanics and to ensure fairness and enjoyment, effects of Awakeners and Wheels of Destiny may be adjusted for balance purposes.
If an adjustment results in weakening, a limited-time Traceback feature will be activated to allow players to redeploy resources for Awakeners and Wheels of Destiny.
Please make resource investments with full awareness and acceptance of this policy.]]
  },
  Summon_14117_LongDesc2 = {
    Text = "<Title:[SSR Items]>\nIn the [Realms Research] Standard Character Awakening, the base probability for SSR items is 3.03%, with overall probability (including guarantees) of 5.02%. All SSR items are Awakeners, with a guaranteed SSR Awakener after maximum 30 Awakenings.\nThe following limited Awakener types from the Faded Legacy have been added to the \"Realms Research\" standard awakening and share a total of 0.5% of the overall SSR Awakener rate in their respective realms, but these limited Awakener types cannot be obtained through the \"Protoparadise\".\n○ [<SummonOrange:Chaos>] Realm: \"Lily,\" \"24,\" \"Ryker,\" \"Hameln,\" \"Tawil\"\n○ [<SummonBlue:Aequor>] Realm: \"Tulu,\" \"Murphy,\" \"Miryam\"\n○ [<SummonRed:Caro>] Realm: \"Sorel,\" \"Salvador,\" \"Thais,\" \"Helot: Catena\"\n○ [<SummonPurple:Ultra>] Realm: \"Daffodil,\" \"Wanda,\" \"Horla\" \n\n<Title:[\"SR Items\"]>\nIn the [Realms Research] Standard Character Awakening, the base probability of obtaining an SR item is 15.85%, and the overall probability (including guarantees) is 25.00%. All SR items in this awakening are Wheel of Destiny. \nGuaranteed SR or higher item every 5 Awakenings, with:\n96.97% chance for SR item.\n3.03% chance for SSR item.\n\n<Title:[Special Notes]>\nSR Wheel of Destiny: 5 Radix Sediments\nR Wheel of Destiny: 1 Radix Sediment\nDuplicate SSR Awakener conversion (including other means of acquisiton, such as the Store and Free Units):\n2nd-16th copies: 1 Awakener Shard + 50 Radix Sediments\n17th+ copies: non-limited SSR Awakeners will convert into 1 Soul Rewind Shard + 150 Radix Sediments\nlimited SSR Awakener will convert into 2 Soul Rewind Shards + 250 Radix Sediments.\nNote: No conversion occurs when an Awakener is obtained through Self-Selection methods (including Protoparadise, Soul Rewind Core, and Prototype Horizon) and Random-drops (such as Sepirot Capture: Faded Legacy).\nThis awakening belongs to [Standard Character Awakening], and the pity awakening count will be accumulated separately, independent of the pity counts of other awakening types. \n\n"
  },
