    Text = "[<SummonRed:Vengeful Beast>] Limited-Time Character Event Awakening is available! During the event, Keepers can awaken the Limited-Time UP Character <SummonRed:Helot: Catena>.\n· During the event, the awakening probability for the Limited SSR Awakener <SummonRed:Helot: Catena> will be increased.\n· After the event ends, the Limited SSR Awakener <SummonRed:Helot: Catena> will continue to appear in Limited-Time Character Event Awakenings for 3 to 9 months after its first Rate-up, before entering the [Realm Study] permanent character awakening pool after approximately one year.\n· In this Limited-Time Awakening, aside from triggered probability increases and special rules like guarantees, all Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny will use the base probability, as specified in the rules.\n· Daily Discount: 60 Silver Prime per Awakening (+60 Silver bonus).\n\n<Title:[Balance Adjustment]>\nDue to the unique gameplay, to ensure game fun and fairness, the game may implement balance adjustments that weaken or enhance the effects of Awakeners and Wheels of Destiny.\nWhen a weakening occurs, the game will enable a Limited-Time Reversion feature to allow for the redeployment of resources for the development or awakening of Awakeners and Wheels of Destiny.\nPlease ensure that you understand and accept this before investing resources."
  },
  Summon_14132_LongDesc2 = {
    Text = [[
<Title:[SSR Items]>
