Please invest resources with this understanding.

]]
  },
  Summon_141454_LongDesc2 = {
    Text = "<Title:[SSR Items]>\n·In the [<SummonBlue:When Stars Align>] Limited Character Event Awakening, the base probability of obtaining an SSR item is 3.03%, and the overall probability (including pity) is 5.02%. All SSR items obtained are Awakeners, and within at most 30 Awakenings, you are guaranteed to obtain an SSR Awakener through pity.\n·When an SSR Awakener is obtained through Awakening, there is a 33.33% chance it will be this period's Rate-Up SSR Awakener <SummonBlue:Tulu>.\n·If the SSR Awakener obtained in 2 consecutive Awakenings is not the current Rate-Up character, then the next SSR character obtained through Awakening is guaranteed to be the current Rate-Up character.{s1}\n·You have currently obtained a non-Rate-Up character {s2} times in a row.{s3}\n\n<Title:[SR Items]>\n·In the [<SummonBlue:When Stars Align>] Character Event Awakening, the base probability of obtaining an SR item is 15.85%, and the overall probability (including pity) is 25.00%. All SR items in this Awakening are Wheels of Destiny.\n·Within at most 5 Awakenings, you are guaranteed to obtain an SR or above item through pity. The probability of obtaining an SR item through pity is 96.97%, and the probability of obtaining an SSR item is 3.03%.\n\n<Title:[Special Notes]>\n·When an SR Wheel of Destiny is obtained through Awakening, 5 Radix Sediments will also be obtained as a byproduct; when an R Wheel of Destiny is obtained, 1 Radix Sediment will also be obtained as a byproduct.\n·Regardless of the method (including but not limited to Awakening, shop exchange, system gifts, etc.), when the same SSR Awakener is obtained for the 2nd–16th time, each instance will be converted into 1 Shard of the corresponding Awakener and 50 Radix Sediments; from the 17th time onward, non-Limited SSR Awakeners will be converted into \"Soul Rewind Shard\" × 1 and \"Radix Sediment\" × 150, while Limited SSR Awakeners will be converted into \"Soul Rewind Shard\" × 2 and \"Radix Sediment\" × 250. However, when Awakeners or excess Awakener Shards are obtained through selective methods (including Protoparadise, Rebirth Core, Prototype Horizon, etc.) or random methods (including Sepirot Capture·Faded Legacy, etc.), Radix Sediments will not be converted.\n·This Awakening belongs to [Character Event Awakening]. In any [Character Event Awakening], pity Awakening counts are accumulated together and are tracked independently from pity counts of other Awakening types."
  },
