  Summon_142865_LongDesc1 = {
    Text = "[<SummonOrange:From Fomalhaut>] Limited WoD Event Awakening is now open. During the event, Keepers can Awaken the Limited event UP Wheel of Destiny <SummonOrange:Amber-Tinted Death>.\n·During the event, the Probability of obtaining the Limited SSR Wheel of Destiny <SummonOrange:Amber-Tinted Death> through Awakening will be increased.\n\n·In this Limited event Awakening, all Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny use base Probability except when special rules such as rate-up or pity are triggered. Please refer to the rules description for details.\n\n<Title:[Balance Adjustments]>\n·Due to the unique nature of the game's mechanics, in order to ensure the enjoyment and fairness of the game, balance adjustments that weaken or strengthen the Effects of Awakeners and Wheels of Destiny may be made.\n·When a nerf occurs, the game will activate a limited-time Reset function to allow Awakeners and Wheels of Destiny to have the opportunity to redeploy resources for their development or Awakening.\n·Please make sure you are aware of and accept this before investing resources."
  },
  Summon_142865_LongDesc2 = {
    Text = "<Title:[SSR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonOrange:From Fomalhaut>] Limited WoD Event Awakening, the base Probability of obtaining SSR items is 3.03%, and the overall Probability(including pity) is 5.02%. All SSR items obtained are Wheels of Destiny, and within at most 30 Awakenings, you are guaranteed to obtain an SSR Wheel of Destiny via pity.\n·When an SSR Wheel of Destiny is obtained through Awakening, there is a 50.00% Probability that it will be the current Rate-Up SSR Wheel of Destiny <SummonOrange:Amber-Tinted Death>.\n·If the last SSR Wheel of Destiny obtained through Awakening was not the current Rate-Up Wheel of Destiny, then the next SSR Wheel of Destiny obtained through Awakening is guaranteed to be the current Rate-Up Wheel of Destiny.\n\n<Title:[SR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonOrange:From Fomalhaut>] WoD Event Awakening, the base Probability of Awakening SR items is 15.85%, and the overall Probability(including pity) is 25.00%. All SR items in this Awakening are Wheels of Destiny.\n·Within at most 5 Awakenings, you are guaranteed to obtain an SR or above item via pity. The Probability of obtaining an SR item via pity is 96.97%, and the Probability of obtaining an SSR item is 3.03%.\n\n<Title:[Special Notes]>\n·When an SSR Wheel of Destiny is obtained through Awakening, 50 Radix Sediment will also be obtained as a byproduct; when an SR Wheel of Destiny is obtained, 5 Radix Sediment will also be obtained as a byproduct; when an R Wheel of Destiny is obtained, 1 Radix Sediment will also be obtained as a byproduct.\n·Regardless of the method used(including but not limited to Awakening, shop exchange, system gifts, etc.), upon obtaining the same SSR Wheel of Destiny for the 2nd~16th time, the Ascension Level will automatically increase and you will receive [ Radix Sediment] ×50 each time; upon the 17th and subsequent obtainments, it will be converted into [Fate Rewind Shard] × 1, [ Radix Sediment] × 50, [Rose Scrip] × 20000; Limited SSR Wheels of Destiny will be converted into [Fate Rewind Shard] × 2, [ Radix Sediment] × 50, [Rose Scrip] × 20000. However, when Wheels of Destiny are obtained through selection methods(including Book of Rotation, Fate Rewind Core, etc.) or random methods(including Fated Capture·Faded Legacy, etc.), Radix Sediment will not be converted.\n·This Awakening belongs to [WoD Event Awakening]. In any [WoD Event Awakening], the pity Awakening count will be accumulated together and counted independently from the pity Awakening counts of other Awakening types."
  },
