In the [<SummonOrange:Sea of Epiphany>] Limited WoD Event Awakening, the base probability for SSR items is 3.03%, with overall probability (including guarantees) of 5.02%. All SSR items are Wheels of Destiny, with a guaranteed SSR WoD after maximum 30 Awakenings.
When obtaining an SSR WoD through Awakening, there is a 50.00% chance it will be the current Rate-Up SSR <SummonOrange:Treasured Rarity>.
If the last SSR WoD obtained was not the Rate-Up SSR WoD, the next SSR WoD will be guaranteed to be the Rate-Up SSR WoD.

<Title:[SR Items]>
In the [<SummonOrange:Sea of Epiphany>] WoD Event Awakening, the base probability for SR items is 15.85%, with overall probability (including guarantees) of 25.00%. All SR items obtained will be Wheels of Destiny.
Guaranteed SR or higher item every 5 Awakenings, with:
96.97% chance for SR item.
3.03% chance for SSR item.

<Title:[Special Notes]>
Additional rewards per Awakening:
SSR Wheel of Destiny: 50 Radix Sediments
SR Wheel of Destiny: 5 Radix Sediments
R Wheel of Destiny: 1 Radix Sediment

Duplicate SSR WoD conversion (including other means of acquisiton, such as the Store and Free Units):
2nd-16th copies: Automatic Ascension + 50 Radix Sediments
17th+ copies: non-limited SSR WoDs will convert into 1 Fate Rewind Shard + 50 Radix Sediments + 20,000 Rose Scrips;
limited SSR WoDs will convert into 2 Fate Rewind Shards + 50 Radix Sediments + 20,000 Rose Scrips
Note: No conversion occurs when a WoD is obtained through Self-Selection methods (including Book of Rotation, Fate Rewind Core, etc) and Random-drops (such as Fated Capture: Faded Legacy).
This Awakening belongs to the [WoD Event Awakening]:
Pity count carries over between all [WoD Event Awakening], and maintains separate counter from other Awakening types.

]]
