  Summon_66939_LongDesc1 = {
    Text = [[
[<SummonPurple:Soul Dispatch>] Limited Character Event Awakening is available! During the event, Keepers can summon the limited-time Rate-Up character <SummonPurple:Daffodil>.
During the event, the summon rate for the limited SSR Awakener <SummonPurple:Daffodil> will be increased.
After the event, the limited SSR Awakener <SummonPurple:Daffodil> will appear in limited-time character event summons 3 to 9 months after the first Rate-Up and will enter the [Realm Study] permanent character summon about a year later.
In this limited-time event summon, all Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny use base rates, except for special rules such as increased rates and guarantees. Refer to the rules for details.
Daily Discount: 60 Silver Prime per Awakening (+60 Silver bonus).

<Title:[Balance Adjustment]>
Because of Morimens' unique gameplay, Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny may be buffed or nerfed via balance adjustments to ensure fun and fairness.
If nerfed, a Limited-Time Reset event allows resource refunds.
Please acknowledge this before investing resources.

]]
  },
  Summon_66939_LongDesc2 = {
    Text = [[
<Title:[SSR Items]>
In the [<SummonPurple:Soul Dispatch>] Limited Character Event Awakening, the base probability for obtaining SSR items is 3.03%, with an overall probability (including guarantees) of 5.02%. All SSR items are Awakeners, with a guaranteed SSR Awakener after maximum 30 Awakenings.
When obtaining an SSR through Awakening, there is a 33.33% chance it will be the current Rate-Up SSR <SummonPurple:Daffodil>.
If two consecutive SSRs obtained through Awakening are not the selected Rate-Up character/Wheel, the next SSR will be guaranteed to be the current period's Rate-Up SSR.
Current status: {s2} consecutive Non Rate-Up characters obtained. {s3} {s1}

<Title:[SR Items]>
In this Event Awakening, the base probability for SR items is 15.85%, with overall probability (including guarantees) of 25.00%. All SR items obtained will be Wheels of Destiny.
Guaranteed SR or higher item every 5 Awakenings, with:
96.97% chance for SR item
3.03% chance for SSR item

<Title:[Special Notes]>
Additional rewards per Awakening:
SR Wheel of Destiny: 5 Radix Sediments
R Wheel of Destiny: 1 Radix Sediment
Duplicate SSR Awakener conversion:
2nd-16th copies: 1 Awakener Shard + 50 Radix Sediments
17th+ copies: non-limited SSR Awakeners will convert into 1 Soul Rewind Shard + 150 Radix Sediments;
limited SSR Awakener will convert into 2 Soul Rewind Shards + 250 Radix Sediments.
Note: No conversion occurs when an Awakener is obtained through Self-Selection methods (including Protoparadise, Soul Rewind Core, and Prototype Horizon) and Random-drops (such as Sepirot Capture: Faded Legacy).

This Awakening belongs to [Character Event Awakening]:
Pity count carries over between all [Character Event Awakening], and maintains separate counter from other Awakening types.

]]
  },
