During the event, the summon rate for the limited SSR Awakener <SummonRed:Salvador> will be increased.
After the event, the limited SSR Awakener <SummonRed:Salvador> will appear in limited-time character event summons 3 to 9 months after the first Rate-Up and will enter the [Realm Study] permanent character summon about a year later.
In this limited-time event summon, all Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny use base rates, except for special rules such as increased rates and guarantees. Refer to the rules for details.
Daily Discount: 60 Silver Prime per Awakening (+60 Silver bonus).

