  Summon_77955_LongDesc1 = {
    Text = "[<SummonBlue:Suggested Translation>] limited-time Character Event Awakening is now open. During the event, Keepers can Awaken the limited-time featured UP character <SummonBlue:Tulu: Godking>.\n·During the event, the Awakening Probability of the limited SSR Awakener <SummonBlue:Tulu: Godking> will be increased.\n·In this limited-time event Awakening, aside from triggering rate-up, guaranteed, and other special rules, all Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny use base Probabilities. Please refer to the detailed rules for specifics.\n·Daily Recommended Awakening: During this limited-time event Awakening, Keepers can perform one discounted Awakening per day for 60 Silver Prime, with an additional bonus of 60 Silver.\n\n<Title:[Balance Adjustments]>\n·Due to the unique nature of the gameplay, the game may apply balance adjustments to weaken or strengthen Effects of Awakeners and Wheels of Destiny to ensure fun and fairness.\n·When a weakening occurs, the game will enable a limited-time Reset function to allow the redeployment of resources invested in Awakener and Wheel of Destiny development or Awakening.\n·Please ensure you acknowledge and accept this before investing resources.\n\n"
  },
  Summon_77955_LongDesc2 = {
    Text = "<Title:[SSR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonBlue:Suggested Translation>] limited-time Character Event Awakening, the base Probability of obtaining SSR items is 3.03%, with a consolidated Probability (including guaranteed) of 5.02%. All SSR items obtained are Awakeners, and a guaranteed SSR Awakener is assured within a maximum of 30 Awakenings.\n·When an SSR Awakener is obtained through Awakening, there is a 33.33% Probability that it will be the current featured SSR Awakener <SummonBlue:Tulu: Godking>.\n·If the SSR Awakeners obtained in 2 consecutive Awakenings are not the current rate-up character, the next SSR character obtained through Awakening is guaranteed to be the current rate-up character.{s1}\n·Currently obtained non-featured UP characters {s2} time(s) in a row.{s3}\n\n<Title:[SR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonBlue:Suggested Translation>] Character Event Awakening, the base Probability of obtaining SR items is 15.85%, with a consolidated Probability (including guaranteed) of 25.00%. All SR items in this Awakening are Wheels of Destiny.\n·A guaranteed SR or higher item is assured within a maximum of 5 Awakenings. The Probability of obtaining an SR item through the guarantee is 96.97%, and the Probability of obtaining an SSR item is 3.03%.\n\n<Title:[Special Notes]>\n·When an SR Wheel of Destiny is obtained through Awakening, 5 Radix Sediments will also be obtained as a byproduct; when an R Wheel of Destiny is obtained, 1 Radix Sediment will also be obtained as a byproduct.\n·Regardless of the method used (including but not limited to Awakening, shop exchange, system gifts, etc.), when the same SSR Awakener is obtained for the 2nd to 16th time, each instance will be converted into 1 corresponding Awakener Shard and 50 Radix Sediments; from the 17th time onward, non-limited SSR Awakeners will be converted into Soul Rewind Shard × 1 and Radix Sediment × 150, while limited SSR Awakeners will be converted into Soul Rewind Shard × 2 and Radix Sediment × 250. However, when obtaining Awakeners or excess Awakener Shards through selection methods (including Protoparadise, Soul Rewind Core, Prototype Horizon, etc.) or random methods (including Sepirot Capture·Faded Legacy, etc.), Radix Sediments will not be converted.\n·This Awakening belongs to [Character Event Awakening]. Across all [Character Event Awakening] banners, the guaranteed Awakening count is shared and accumulated, and is tracked independently from the guaranteed Awakening counts of other Awakening types.\n\n"
  },
