  },
  Summon_78006_LongDesc1 = {
    Text = "[<SummonBlue:Suggested Translation>] Limited-Time WoD Event Awakening is now available. During the event, Keepers can Awaken the limited-time featured rate-up Wheel of Destiny <SummonBlue:Tulu: Sovereign's Signature Weapon>.\n·During the event, the Awakening Probability of obtaining the limited SSR Wheel of Destiny <SummonBlue:Tulu: Sovereign's Signature Weapon> will be increased.\n·In this limited-time event Awakening, aside from triggered Probability increases, guaranteed pity, and other special rules, all Awakeners and Wheels of Destiny use base Probability. Please refer to the detailed rules for specifics.\n·Daily Recommended Awakening: During this limited-time event Awakening, Keepers can perform one discounted Awakening per day for 60 Silver Prime, with an additional bonus of 60 Silver.\n\n<Title:[Balance Adjustments]>\n·Due to the unique nature of the gameplay, the game may apply balance adjustments to nerf or buff Effects of Awakeners and Wheels of Destiny to ensure fun and fairness.\n·When nerfs occur, the game will enable a limited-time Reset function to give Keepers the opportunity to redeploy resources spent on Awakener and Wheel of Destiny progression or Awakening.\n·Please make sure you acknowledge and accept this before investing resources.\n\n"
  },
  Summon_78006_LongDesc2 = {
    Text = "<Title:[SSR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonBlue:Suggested Translation>] Limited-Time WoD Event Awakening, the base Probability of obtaining an SSR item is 3.03%, with a consolidated Probability(including pity) of 5.02%. All SSR items obtained are Wheels of Destiny, and an SSR Wheel of Destiny is guaranteed through pity within a maximum of 30 Awakenings.\n·When an SSR Wheel of Destiny is obtained through Awakening, there is a 50.00% Probability that it will be the current featured rate-up SSR Wheel of Destiny <SummonBlue:Tulu: Sovereign's Signature Weapon>.\n·If the last SSR Wheel of Destiny obtained through Awakening was not the current rate-up Wheel of Destiny, the next SSR Wheel of Destiny obtained through Awakening is guaranteed to be the current rate-up Wheel of Destiny.\n\n<Title:[SR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonBlue:Suggested Translation>] WoD Event Awakening, the base Probability of Awakening an SR item is 15.85%, with a consolidated Probability(including pity) of 25.00%. All SR items in this Awakening are Wheels of Destiny.\n·An SR or higher item is guaranteed through pity within a maximum of 5 Awakenings. The Probability of obtaining an SR item through pity is 96.97%, and the Probability of obtaining an SSR item is 3.03%.\n\n<Title:[Special Notes]>\n·When an SSR Wheel of Destiny is obtained through Awakening, 50 Radix Sediment will also be obtained as a byproduct; when an SR Wheel of Destiny is obtained, 5 Radix Sediment will also be obtained as a byproduct; when an R Wheel of Destiny is obtained, 1 Radix Sediment will also be obtained as a byproduct.\n·Regardless of the method used(including but not limited to Awakening, shop exchange, system gifts, etc.), obtaining the same SSR Wheel of Destiny for the 2nd through 16th time will automatically increase its Stacking Level and grant [Radix Sediment] ×50 each time; from the 17th time onward, it will be converted into [Fate Rewind Shard] × 1, [Radix Sediment] × 50, [Rose Scrip] × 20000. Limited SSR Wheels of Destiny will be converted into [Fate Rewind Shard] × 2, [Radix Sediment] × 50, [Rose Scrip] × 20000. However, when obtaining Wheels of Destiny through selection methods(including Book of Rotation, Fate Rewind Core, etc.) or random methods(including Fate Frozen in Time·Faded Legacy, etc.), Radix Sediment will not be converted.\n·This Awakening belongs to [WoD Event Awakening]. Across all [WoD Event Awakening] banners, guaranteed pity counts are shared and tracked independently from pity counts of other Awakening types.\n"
  },
