  Summon_78009_LongDesc1 = {
    Text = "[<SummonPurple:Temporary Text>] Limited WoD Event Awakening is now open. During the event, Keepers can Awaken the limited event Rate-Up Wheel of Destiny <SummonPurple:Tinct: Vespera Signature Weapon>.\n·During the event, the Awakening probability for the limited SSR Wheel of Destiny <SummonPurple:Tinct: Vespera Signature Weapon> will be increased.\n·In this limited event Awakening, all Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny use base probabilities except when special rules such as Rate-Up or pity are triggered. Please refer to the rules for details.\n·Daily Recommended Awakening: During this limited event Awakening, Keepers can perform one Awakening per day at the discounted price of 60 Silver Prime, with an additional 60 Silver gifted.\n\n<Title:[Balance Adjustments]>\n·Due to the unique nature of the game's mechanics, in order to ensure fairness and enjoyment, the game may make balance adjustments to nerf or buff Effects on Awakeners and Wheels of Destiny.\n·When a nerf occurs, the game will enable a limited-time Reset function to allow Awakeners and Wheels of Destiny to have the opportunity to redeploy resources for cultivation or Awakening.\n·Please be sure to invest resources only after understanding and accepting this."
  },
  Summon_78009_LongDesc2 = {
    Text = "<Title:[SSR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonPurple:Temporary Text>] Limited WoD Event Awakening, the base probability of obtaining an SSR item is 3.03%, and the overall probability (including pity) is 5.02%. All SSR items obtained are Wheels of Destiny, and a pity SSR Wheel of Destiny is guaranteed within at most 30 Awakenings.\n·When an SSR Wheel of Destiny is obtained through Awakening, there is a 50.00% chance it will be the current Rate-Up SSR Wheel of Destiny <SummonPurple:Tinct: Vespera Signature Weapon>.\n·If the SSR Wheel of Destiny obtained in the last Awakening was not the current Rate-Up Wheel of Destiny, then the next SSR Wheel of Destiny obtained through Awakening is guaranteed to be the current Rate-Up Wheel of Destiny.\n\n<Title:[SR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonPurple:Temporary Text>] WoD Event Awakening, the base probability of obtaining an SR item is 15.85%, and the overall probability (including pity) is 25.00%. All SR items in this Awakening are Wheels of Destiny.\n·A pity SR or above item is guaranteed within at most 5 Awakenings. The probability of obtaining an SR item via pity is 96.97%, and the probability of obtaining an SSR item is 3.03%.\n\n<Title:[Special Notes]>\n·When an SSR Wheel of Destiny is obtained through Awakening, 50 Radix Sediments will also be obtained as a byproduct; when an SR Wheel of Destiny is obtained, 5 Radix Sediments will also be obtained as a byproduct; when an R Wheel of Destiny is obtained, 1 Radix Sediment will also be obtained as a byproduct.\n·Regardless of the method used (including but not limited to Awakening, shop exchange, system gifts, etc.), the 2nd through 16th time the same SSR Wheel of Destiny is obtained, each instance will automatically increase the Ascension Level and grant \"Radix Sediment\" × 50; from the 17th time onward, it will be converted into \"Fate Rewind Shard\" × 1, \"Radix Sediment\" × 50, and \"Rose Scrip\" × 20000, while limited SSR Wheels of Destiny will be converted into \"Fate Rewind Shard\" × 2, \"Radix Sediment\" × 50, and \"Rose Scrip\" × 20000. However, when Wheels of Destiny are obtained through selective methods (including Book of Rotation, Fate Rewind Core, etc.) or random methods (including Fated Capture·Faded Legacy, etc.), Radix Sediments will not be converted.\n·This Awakening belongs to [WoD Event Awakening]. In any [WoD Event Awakening], pity Awakening counts are accumulated together and tracked independently from pity counts of other Awakening types."
