  Summon_81451_LongDesc1 = {
    Text = [[
[Argent Dawnlight] is a Novice Character Awakening. Keepers can awaken unlimited times until they obtain the desired Awakener.
In the [Argent Dawnlight] Novice Character Awakening, each Keeper has unlimited free re-awakening opportunities until the awakening result is confirmed, and every 5 Awakenings will guarantee a random standard SSR Awakener.
After confirming the Awakening result, the [Argent Dawnlight] Awakening Event will be closed.
