  Summon_94430_LongDesc2 = {
    Text = "<Title:[SSR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonOrange:Temporary Text>] Limited Character Event Awakening, the base probability of obtaining an SSR item is 3.03%, and the overall probability (including pity) is 5.02%. All SSR items obtained are Awakeners, and within at most 30 Awakenings, you are guaranteed to obtain an SSR Awakener through pity.\n·When an SSR Awakener is obtained through Awakening, there is a 33.33% chance it will be the current UP SSR Awakener <SummonOrange:Genesis Ogier>.\n·If the SSR Awakener obtained in 2 consecutive Awakenings is not the current Rate-Up character, then the next SSR character obtained through Awakening is guaranteed to be the current Rate-Up character.{s1}\n·You have currently obtained a non-UP character {s2} times in a row.{s3}\n\n<Title:[SR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonOrange:Temporary Text>] Character Event Awakening, the base probability of obtaining an SR item is 15.85%, and the overall probability (including pity) is 25.00%. All SR items in this Awakening are Wheels of Destiny.\n·Within at most 5 Awakenings, you are guaranteed to obtain an SR or above item through pity. The probability of obtaining an SR item through pity is 96.97%, and the probability of obtaining an SSR item is 3.03%.\n\n<Title:[Special Notes]>\n·When an SR Wheel of Destiny is obtained through Awakening, 5 Radix Sediment will also be obtained as a byproduct; when an R Wheel of Destiny is obtained, 1 Radix Sediment will also be obtained as a byproduct.\n·Regardless of the method used (including but not limited to Awakening, shop exchange, system gifts, etc.), the 2nd through 16th time the same SSR Awakener is obtained, each instance will be converted into 1 Shard of the corresponding Awakener and 50 Radix Sediment; from the 17th time onward, non-Limited SSR Awakeners will be converted into \"Soul Rewind Shard\" × 1 and \"Radix Sediment\" × 150, while Limited SSR Awakeners will be converted into \"Soul Rewind Shard\" × 2 and \"Radix Sediment\" × 250. However, when Awakeners or overflow Awakener Shards are obtained through selection methods (including Protoparadise, Rebirth Core, Prototype Horizon, etc.) or random methods (including Sepirot Capture·Faded Legacy, etc.), Radix Sediment will not be converted.\n·This Awakening belongs to [Character Event Awakening]. In any [Character Event Awakening], the pity Awakening count will be accumulated together and is tracked independently from the pity counts of other Awakening types."
