  Summon_98111_LongDesc2 = {
    Text = "<Title:[SSR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonOrange:Kaleido Recollections>] Walks of All Life Awakening, the base probability to obtain an SSR item is 3.03%, and the overall probability (including guaranteed odds) is 5.02%. SSR items are Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny, with a guaranteed SSR item after maximum 30 Awakenings.\nWhen obtaining an SSR item through awakening, there is a 33.33% chance it will be an SSR Awakener.\nIf two consecutive awakenings result in an SSR Wheel of Destiny, the next SSR obtained through awakening will definitely be an Awakener.\nIf two consecutive awakenings result in an SSR Awakener, the next SSR obtained through awakening will definitely be a Wheel of Destiny.{s1}\nYou have currently consecutively obtained SSR Awakeners for {s2} <plural value=\"{s2}\" singular=\"time\" plural=\"times\">.{s3}\nYou have currently consecutively obtained SSR Wheels of Destiny for {s4} <plural value=\"{s4}\" singular=\"time\" plural=\"times\">.{s3}\n\n<Title:[SR Item]>\nIn the Character Event Awakening of [<SummonOrange:Kaleido Recollections>], the base probability to obtain an SR item is 15.85%, and the overall probability (including guaranteed odds) is 25.00%. All SR items in this awakening are Wheels of Destiny.\nAfter a maximum of 5 awakenings, you are guaranteed to obtain an SR or higher item through the guaranteed odds. The probability of obtaining an SR item through guaranteed odds is 96.97%, and the probability of obtaining an SSR item is 3.03%.\n\n<Title:[Special Notes]>\nWhen obtaining an SSR Wheel of Destiny through awakening, you will also receive 50 Radix Sediments as a byproduct; when obtaining an SR Wheel of Destiny through awakening, you will also receive 5 Radix Sediments as a byproduct; when obtaining an R Wheel of Destiny, you will also receive 1 Radix Sediment as a byproduct.\nRegardless of the method used (including but not limited to awakening, shop exchange, system gifts, etc.), upon obtaining the same SSR Wheel of Destiny for the 2nd–16th time, the stacking level will automatically increase and you will receive \"Radix Sediments\" ×50 each time;\nfrom the 17th time onward, it will convert into \"Fate Rewind Shard\" ×1 + \"Radix Sediments\" ×50 + \"Rose Gold Voucher\" ×20000;\nfor limited SSR Wheels of Destiny, it will convert into \"Fate Rewind Shard\" ×2 + \"Radix Sediments\" ×50 + \"Rose Gold Voucher\" ×20000.\n\nUpon obtaining the same SSR Awakener for the 2nd–16th time, it will convert into 1 corresponding Awakener Shard + 50 Radix Sediments each time;\nfrom the 17th time onward, non-limited SSR Awakeners will convert into \"Soul Rewind Shard\" ×1 + \"Radix Sediments\" ×150, and limited SSR Awakeners will convert into \"Soul Rewind Shard\" ×2 + \"Radix Sediments\" ×250.\n\nNote: No conversion occurs when an Awakener is obtained through Self-Selection methods (including Protoparadise, Soul Rewind Core, and Prototype Horizon) and Random-drops (such as Sepirot Capture: Faded Legacy).\nThis awakening belongs to the [Walks of All Life Awakening]. In any [Walks of All Life Awakening], the guaranteed awakening count will be accumulated collectively, and it will be statistically independent from the guaranteed awakening counts of other awakening types."
  },
