  Summon_98113_LongDesc1 = {
    Text = [[
[<SummonOrange:The Timeless Call>] Limited Event Awakening is available!
During the event, the selected <SummonOrange:SSR Awakener and Their Recommended Wheel of Destiny> enjoy boosted drop rates.
Except for special rules (e.g., rate boosts, guarantees), all drops use base probabilities. See Rules for details.

<Title:[Balance Adjustment]>
Because of Morimens' unique gameplay, Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny may be buffed or nerfed via balance adjustments to ensure fun and fairness.
If nerfed, a Limited-Time Reset event allows resource refunds.
Please acknowledge this before investing resources.

]]
  },
  Summon_98113_LongDesc2 = {
    Text = [[
<Title:[SSR Items]>
In the [<SummonOrange:The Timeless Call>] Limited Event Awakening, the base probability for obtaining SSR items is 3.03%, with an overall probability (including guarantees) of 5.02%. Obtained SSR items will be either an Awakener or Wheel of Destiny, with a guaranteed SSR Awakener or recommended Wheel of Destiny after maximum 30 Awakenings.
When obtaining an SSR through Awakening, there is a 33.33% chance it will be the current Rate-Up SSR <SummonOrange:Awakener or Their Recommended Wheel of Destiny>.
If the SSR obtained through Awakening is not the selected Rate-Up character/Wheel, the next SSR will be guaranteed to be a Rate-Up SSR.
Current status: {s2} consecutive Non Rate-Up Awakeners or WoD obtained. {s3}
If you get the same Rate-Up item twice in a row, the next Rate-Up item is guaranteed to be different.
Current status: {s4} Rate-Up Awakeners in a row.
{s5} Rate-Up WoDs in a row.
<Title:[SR Items]>
In this Event Awakening, the base probability for SR items is 15.85%, with overall probability (including guarantees) of 25.00%. All SR items obtained will be Wheels of Destiny.
Guaranteed SR or higher item every 5 Awakenings, with:

96.97% chance for SR item
3.03% chance for SSR item
<Title:[Special Notes]>
Additional rewards per Awakening:

SSR Wheel of Destiny: 50 Radix Sediments
SR Wheel of Destiny: 5 Radix Sediments
R Wheel of Destiny: 1 Radix Sediment
Duplicate SSR Awakener conversion:
2nd-16th copies: 1 Awakener Shard + 50 Radix Sediments
17th+ copies: non-limited SSR Awakeners will convert into 1 Soul Rewind Shard + 150 Radix Sediments
limited SSR Awakener will convert into 2 Soul Rewind Shards + 250 Radix Sediments. 
Note: No conversion occurs when an Awakener is obtained through Self-Selection methods (including Protoparadise, Soul Rewind Core, and Prototype Horizon) and Random-drops (such as Sepirot Capture: Faded Legacy).
This Awakening belongs to [Chronos Mandate]:
Pity count carries over between all [Chronos Mandate], and maintains separate counter from other Awakening types.

]]
  },
